        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Replacement Door Latch for Nostalgic Warehouse</b>\r\n<p>\r\nOptional for Privacy or Passage <b>Door Knobs</b>. Available in 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. For new installations or restoration replacement. <b>8 mm hub</b> in the latch for use with 8 mm spindle.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-tube-latch-size.gif?v=1704354722\" width=\"580\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Nostalgic Warehouse  Door Latch Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFits Nostalgic Warehouse <a href=\"/products/white-porcelain-knobs-with-spindle-nostalgic-warehouse\"><b>Porcelain Knobs</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/crystal-knobs-with-spindle-nostalgic-warehouse\"><b>Crystal Knobs</b></a> \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n*Sold as a set: Door latch with square corner face plate, square corner full lip strike plate and installation screws. <br>\r\nNote: <b>8 mm hub</b> in the latch for use with 8 mm spindle.\r\n</p>",
